<title>USA: Express Scripts pharmacy enrollment up.</title>
<headline>Express Scripts pharmacy enrollment up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Express Scripts Inc said Wednesday that enrollment in its pharmacy benefit management programs hit the 12 million mark for the first time as of July 1.</p>
<p>Express Scripts said enrollment grew by 700,000 members between the first and second quarters, reaching 11.6 million as of June 30. Since the end of the second quarter, it added about 400,000 more members.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
